# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values.
# .env.local is gitignored — never commit real keys.
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to client code,
# and the dev server must be restarted after changing them.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# CARTO basemap tiles for the Interactive Map (src/components/ProjectMap/MapPanel.jsx).
# Optional. Without it the map falls back to Esri's keyless light-grey canvas,
# which renders cleanly — CARTO is only needed to restore the Positron styling.
# Note this key ships in the client bundle, so restrict it by domain in the
# CARTO dashboard. Get one at https://carto.com/basemaps
VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=YOUR_KEY_HERE
